WEBVTT

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:14.000
Ray Dawn! Ray Dawn! Ray Dawn! Ray Dawn...!

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:23.540
This world's crime, punishment,
pain, suffering, sorrow, joy...

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:27.750
All of it belongs to we humans.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:38.290
Even if you get revenge, the past won't change.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:41.370
I realize that.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:46.370
I don't need a past or a future.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:49.000
I'll see he gets what he deserves.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:52.120
That's good enough for me.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.790
By order of His Excellency the prime minister,
we of Dorothea will accompany you to Tsubal.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.870
Director Auler is still in Hybranz?

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:09.750
Yes, sir.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.120
I'm in your hands, then.

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:12.370
Yes, sir!

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:28.450
I'll see he gets what he deserves.

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:30.500
That's good enough for me.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:08.500
"Episode 14"
"Wheel-Stopping Castle"

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.370
Kal-o again?

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:20.500
You can stop complaining.

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:25.330
Until Tsubal.

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:30.290
We're just going to escort Ray Dawn...
Duke Kal-o, then come back?

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:33.410
Yeah, that's our mission.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:56.410
I won't let you get away.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:35.000
Where's Ray Dawn?!

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:38.750
What?! What happened?!

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.080
A-An explosion?! Why?!

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:42.160
It wasn't an accident!

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:43.250
Yeah.

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:44.410
Check on the situation!

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:46.040
--Will do.
--Yes sir!

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:48.660
Whoa!

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:50.080
Oh no!

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.750
Duke Kal-o!

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:02.410
The Dorothea...

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:04.620
Free!

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:05.910
Take my hand!

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:30.950
Seems the castle was built over 300 years ago,
and it's fallen badly into disuse.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:36.700
There are no towns around here,
much less a train station.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:38.660
We'll just have to stay the night here.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:42.120
Well, it's not like we can
sleep out in the open.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:47.870
Duke Kal-o, this way.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.870
Enter.

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.290
Never seen you before.

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:16.870
My name is Michel Connor, Duke Kal-o.

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:23.580
Connor... A descendant of Timothy Connor,
who wrote the <i>Red Fairy Tome</i> ?

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:26.620
"Michel Connor"

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:26.620
Indeed I am.

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:30.910
It's good to see you're safe, Duke Kal-o.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:36.410
Looks like someone is out to kill me.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:39.750
Success does invite envy.

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:45.410
The Diese sect and Arcame
remnants probably hate me.

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:49.080
And you, for turning traitor.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:52.830
What about Golbarn?

00:06:54.200 --> 00:06:57.950
The prime minister?
In that case, it's a bold move.

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:02.290
Deep down, the prime minister
must want you to rebel as well,

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:06.580
but he probably can't move now,
while he has no legitimate reason to kill you.

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:10.160
Which means, it's Arcame.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:18.120
Guard <i>this</i> rundown place? Easier said than done.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:22.450
We'll just have to do our best for now.

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:25.500
And reinforcements should be
here come tomorrow morning.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:34.450
I wonder if the enemy will stop
at blowing up the bridge?

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:37.000
Let's hope so.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:42.450
This is not the age of knights,
yet here we are, defending a castle.

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:57.080
I'll take him by surprise.
That's the only way to kill that man.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:11.830
Are you standing watch properly?

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:15.750
Yeah, I am. I'm watching my eyes right out.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:22.000
I really am watching.
It doesn't mean I can't yawn.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:22.910
Fine.

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.750
No, I really...

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:27.200
Klara, do you hear something?

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.620
Use Tommelise.

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.750
Artificial fairies! Five apiece! Ten total!

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:47.330
That figures!

00:08:51.160 --> 00:08:52.410
Take this!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.870
It's not stopping!

00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:59.200
Sir!

00:09:03.290 --> 00:09:04.790
Here they come!

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:09.200
You'll get run over!

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:17.330
It's an enemy attack.

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:21.870
Michel, let's play it safe.
Take Duke Kal-o and get away from here.

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:31.290
Will you kill them all
personally using Sororias?

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:35.700
The way you mowed down Diese and his men?

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:39.200
If that's what you wish, I will not stop you.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.450
This way.

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:53.790
Their target is Ray Dawn!

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:56.830
We'll look into that later!
Let's get this under control, fast!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:02.870
Get into position!

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.200
Ow!

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:18.120
Serge!

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:19.370
How dare you!

00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.080
Who're you?

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:48.620
Nice skills. You're no Arcame remnant.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:51.080
Where is Ray Dawn?

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.620
I'll make this quick.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:07.120
That fairy...

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:33.950
Can you keep going?!

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:35.080
You bet.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:36.620
Now, sir!

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:42.450
Let's go!

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:43.870
Yes, sir!

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:46.000
Here come more artificial fairies!

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:49.870
Marlya, cover me!

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:51.080
Got it!

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:56.910
Oh no you don't.

00:11:59.830 --> 00:12:01.540
That's one I owe you.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.830
These are Arcame artificial fairies?

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:14.160
The enemy's already inside?!

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:15.540
Let's go, Marlya!

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:16.620
Yes, sir!

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.200
Why are you after Duke Kal-o?

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:37.290
You probably don't know what he did at Suna.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:38.790
You wouldn't understand if I told you.

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:41.540
Are you telling me you're a Suna survivor?

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:45.790
You're fairy-possessed.

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:47.370
So what?

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:53.870
That fairy... Now I get it.

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:09.950
It's so powerful!

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:25.750
Ver!

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:28.120
Wolfran, it's you!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.370
Good luck and bad are
two sides of the same coin.

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:50.120
Ver!

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:52.910
She's not coming up!

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:56.700
Marlya!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:16.950
"8 years ago"

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:16.950
Where am I?

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:20.500
Ah, you're awake.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:25.500
I'm Damien Carme, a humble fairy scholar.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:26.830
And you?

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.200
Fairy scholar?

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:32.830
Yes, from a long line.

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:38.250
My ancestor is Crucia Albastora,
who wrote the <i>Black Fairy Tome</i> .

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:42.160
But your name's Damien "Carme."

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:47.040
Yes, it would limit me in a number
of ways if my lineage came to light.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:50.540
That's why I use an alias.

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:54.750
A fairy... There were lots
of them in Suna's forest.

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:57.950
Are you from Suna?

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:01.500
This one is afraid, and distressed.

00:15:05.910 --> 00:15:09.250
You mean... it's visible to you?

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:13.500
Even Suna residents should only
be able to see fairy primordials

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:15.660
with the naked eye at a very young age.

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:18.700
Are you scared? Are you sad?

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:21.910
Would you just as soon vanish?

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:24.040
That's how I feel too.

00:16:00.660 --> 00:16:02.000
Take it easy.

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:06.160
Marlya.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:07.830
I'm glad.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.200
About what?

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:12.250
Because you don't seem to be hurt too badly.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:18.410
You brought me here... by yourself?

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:19.750
Yeah.

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:22.750
Do you realize what you're doing?

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:24.870
I just...

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:28.500
I just wanted to save you.

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:33.540
A fairy?

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:36.750
Ah. It's a lightning bug.

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:40.660
I was fooled at first, too.

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:42.250
They sure are pretty.

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:55.500
Do it!

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:02.120
There it goes.

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:30.040
You deserted the military,
and fell in with Arcame!

00:17:30.040 --> 00:17:31.950
That's a long way to fall!

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:33.830
Shut your mouth.

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:42.660
You don't get to lecture me.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:47.950
You think getting a collar put on you by
Unified Zesskia makes you a good dog?

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:52.120
Who are you to talk?!
You're in a gang of scoundrels!

00:17:52.120 --> 00:17:54.870
Your eyes don't see a thing.

00:17:54.870 --> 00:17:56.370
Huh?

00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:58.000
You're wearing blinders.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:02.950
Do you remember what happened at Suna?

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:04.290
Yeah.

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:06.660
I think about it all the time.

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:09.370
I try not to think about it.

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.620
Why are you in Dorothea?

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:15.790
When did you gain the use of a fairy?

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:19.910
That day we met, I was
working security at the auction.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:23.160
You got your fairy... that day?

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:27.080
Right. It went directly into my body.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.450
That's not normal, is it?

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:35.410
Even Fairy Soldiers have to
undergo surgery first, I hear.

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:36.830
How about you, Ver?

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:44.080
Have you been after Ray Dawn all this time?

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:47.620
Do you think he has the right to live?

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:48.830
Well...

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:52.330
You're guarding <i>him</i> of all people.

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:54.450
What's the big idea?!

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:56.410
Big idea...?

00:18:56.410 --> 00:19:00.790
If you remember what happened that day,
you'd never try to stop me!

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:05.700
But... even if you kill Ray Dawn... Suna is...

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:09.000
You can't get back what you've lost,
so just forget about it?!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:11.950
That's not it! I understand.

00:19:11.950 --> 00:19:15.040
I understand how you feel.

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:17.120
So much that it hurts.

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:18.870
Then don't stand in my way!

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:20.040
No!

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:24.660
You're right here!

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.660
I haven't lost you, Ver!

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:27.410
Let go!

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:28.700
I won't!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:42.160
What the hell happened?!

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:51.660
Dammit!

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.580
Why?!

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:01.080
Unlike me, you've got a family!

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:07.750
Didn't you go see them after you left the army?!

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:12.080
Did something happen to
your wife and daughter?!

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:16.250
I won't tell you to shut your mouth anymore.

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:18.120
I'll silence you myself.

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:25.250
You would never understand!

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:28.750
This ain't like you!

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:53.450
For what purpose do you fight?

00:20:53.450 --> 00:20:58.370
What do you protect? Country? Comrades?

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:00.540
What will you have left?

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:03.370
I...!

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:06.790
Wolfran, wait!

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.000
Now, I...

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:15.540
Right now, I understand how you feel!

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.250
That's why I want to stop you!

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:20.830
You want me to forgive him,
and go find serenity or something?!

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:22.200
That's not it!

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:26.540
I have nothing! It was all taken from me!

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:28.830
It was all destroyed!

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:31.290
You have me!

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:33.580
You and I are alive!

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:38.580
You have... me.

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:43.790
Be quiet!

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:49.620
Ver!

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:54.580
I'm not going to give up!

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:57.080
I won't let it end like this!

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:00.620
I...

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:04.870
Even if I lose sight of you...

00:22:04.870 --> 00:22:07.250
...you can bet I'll find you again!

00:23:39.200 --> 00:23:45.080
Marlya's childhood friend Veronica
is out to get Duke Kal-o.

00:23:42.200 --> 00:23:46.040
Nothing good comes of my getting involved.

00:23:45.080 --> 00:23:48.540
Can't you trust us?

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:48.540
"Next time"
"Weeding the Back Streets"
